  "work": {
    "abstract_text": "Using Mathar's root-generating-function theorem (2021, Theorem 5), we give an alternative coefficient proof of his conjecture in OEIS A157100, revision 14, FORMULA line 11 (5 February 2015), for every n >= 4. We correct the generating-function ratio accompanying its partial-sum description and extend the calculation to the adjacent sequence A025262: its linear recurrence implies Somos's bilinear identity by elimination of the index. The same radical identity proves Mathar's six-term conjecture for A025268 on its fully defined domain n >= 6. We also derive the related coefficient formulas, shifted generating functions, and the leading asymptotic constants.",
